      the loading of other HTML/templating pages that they may not be authorized
      to render. An attacker may attempt to use directory traversal techniques
      e.g. `../folder/index` to access other HTML pages on the file system.
      Where possible, do not allow users to define what should be  loaded in
      $RES.render or use an allow list for the existing application.
