## 8. Integration Points (TD Platform)

When bundled with ThreatDiviner platform:

| Integration | Mechanism |
|-------------|-----------|
| **Auth context** | TD JWT contains `tenant_id`, `user_id`, `roles` — Threat Modeling service validates and extracts |
