### 11.1 Flow Diagram

```
┌──────────┐    ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────┐
│    PR    │───▶│ Webhook  │───▶│  Queue   │───▶│ Analysis │───▶│   Post   │
│  Opened  │    │ Received │    │   Job    │    │   Run    │    │ Results  │
